closing argument is fully proved, sorry-free:

  right-factor relations ⇒ coefficient sum telescopes to 0
    (`cert_annihilates_one`)
  ⇒ the constant-1 sequence satisfies `L`
  ⇒ `d = 1` by `recurrence_unique` (`QTSPP.Stembridge`).

Plugging in recovered coefficients reduces to discharging the structure
